The newly added `ReportFieldsListValuesTableHeaderProps` type declares two props (`headerButtons` and `shouldDisplayButtonsInSeparateLine`), but neither has a `/** ... */` block comment. Per STYLE.md, every component prop should be documented with a JSDoc block comment at its definition site so its purpose is clear.

Add a `/** */` block above each prop:

```tsx
type ReportFieldsListValuesTableHeaderProps = {
    /** Action buttons rendered inline when they should appear on a separate line */
    headerButtons: React.ReactNode;

    /** Whether the header buttons should render on their own line above the subtitle */
