The newly added `WorkspaceContextProps` component props type declares a prop with no `/** ... */` block comment above it. Per `STYLE.md`, every component prop must be documented with a JSDoc block comment so its purpose is clear at the definition site. Since this type declares its own prop and none of them are documented, it should carry a doc block.

Add a `/** */` description above the prop:

```tsx
type WorkspaceContextProps = {
    /** The policy whose avatar and name identify the workspace suggestion row */
